Package: cigamingos-gaming
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: CiGaming <admin@snugglesmp.com>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: cigamingos-desktop (= @VERSION@),
 gamemode, mangohud, mesa-vulkan-drivers, vulkan-tools, mesa-utils,
 openjdk-21-jre, joystick, wine, winetricks
Recommends: steam-installer, goverlay, gamescope
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: CiGaming OS gaming add-on
 Steam (with Proton), GameMode, MangoHud, Vulkan drivers, Wine and Java
 for Minecraft. Steam needs the i386 architecture enabled; the CiGaming
 OS image does that for you, or run:
   sudo dpkg --add-architecture i386 && sudo apt update
